OL,3,AAdidas sues Australian label White Fox
OL,4,Aover four stripes design
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdidas is suing Australian label White
OL,7,FFox for selling and advertising clothes
OL,8,Fwith a four-striped design, arguing it
OL,9,Fis "deceptively similar" to the German
OL,10,Fbrand's distinct logo.
OL,12,FThe sportswear giant said it had
OL,13,Frepeatedly asked White Fox to stop
OL,14,Fselling and promoting the clothes since
OL,15,FMarch, but the Sydney-based company
OL,16,Frefused.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
